          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We add the exponents, as follows:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: a^{9} \u22c5 a^{7}|=; a^{9 + 7}|=; a^{16}]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We add the exponents, as follows:\n\n[MATH: a^{9} \u22c5 a^{7}|=; a^{9 + 7}|=; a^{16}]",
