          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We add the exponents, as follows:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: x^{2} \u22c5 x^{3} \u22c5 x^{4}|=; x^{2 + 3 + 4}|=; x^{9}]</span></p><p>Therefore <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x^{n}=x^9]</span>, so <span class=\"math\">[MATH: n=9.]</span></p>",
